, .env, .tally, .claude, .codex, site/, scripts that are not needed), empty-cache clean-prefix install, then: tally --version, tally logo TTY and non-TTY, tally demo, tally doctor in a scratch repo, tally init --help, tally run --plan on a config with parallelWorkers and modelAccessFallbackTier, tally market --replay with the cached report. (5) Report the tarball path, file count, size, sha, and the exact publish command with --otp placeholder. DO NOT publish: Vaibhaav must run it himself with his 2FA code, and only after lane A's one AO sanity run on the final commit passes. Keep the routing-evidence report regenerating in the background when passes B and C land, but this comes first.","text_elements":[]}]},"started_at_ms":1791803435931,"completed_at_ms":1791803435931}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T11:10:43.137Z","ordinal":15772,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a125af-5d46-7871-9bed-a128df2c2957","turn_id":"01a12fce-a573-76b3-a414-d175a23cff76","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0987d0060851d607016accc030dc508191ac9f1783e58b6173","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’ll handle the 0.2.0 version and compatibility checks first, investigate both AO defects, then audit and test the built release package. I won’t publish; the final handoff will include the tarball details and the command for Vaibhaav’s 2FA approval."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1791803441061,"completed_at_ms":1791803443137}}
