{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T11:40:12.323Z","ordinal":16295,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0987d0060851d607016accc713104881918c712a8ace686158","status":"completed","call_id":"call_60137c02b3a143e6bfe8b67c3b87dde0","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"ao report --checkpoint --note '0.2.0 final audit complete: built release e642e69, source/main still 6196474. Tarball attached: 279 files, 469570 bytes, unpacked 1681966; SHA1 05765d75cf34d8cc6785ab38890a9275d17ad08b. Required assets present, forbidden files/credential values absent. Empty-cache/clean-prefix version, logo TTY/nonTTY, demo, doctor, help, valid plan (parallelWorkers + fallback), cached market replay checked. Separate Node20 clean install passes version/demo/plan/replay; Vitest absent. npm protobufjs postinstall warnings retained, not bypassed. Empty-home doctor correctly misses sign-in; authenticated AO/Codex doctor connected. Exact OTP publish command and SHA256 in report; NOT run. Await lane A sanity and Vaibhaav publication. ao send unavailable because orchestrator awaits a permission decision; durable report used.' --artifact /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/release-020/report.md --artifact /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/release-020/tally-agents-0.2.0.tgz\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Persist the completed prerelease audit and tarball through AO's report channel.\"}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"sed -n '5,42p' /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/routing-evidence/report.md\",\"max_output_tokens\":2000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12fdc-361d-7d60-86d2-5cd5884aa9f4","create_time":1791805203.0712054}}}
