{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T11:42:11.066Z","ordinal":16317,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0987d0060851d607016accc78ba8cc81919879a168892e9d9a","status":"completed","call_id":"call_3e41a12b7dc5404e83e794f80640d913","name":"exec","input":"const html='<html><body><style>body{font:14px var(--font-sans);color:var(--foreground)}p{line-height:1.5}img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}</style><p>Three matched tasks, one run each per pass. A baseline: $0.40565/task; B priors: $0.10311/task; C history-enabled: $0.14211/task. All passed; each pass had 3 model attempts and 3 separate startup retries. Only the large C task used observed history, with no tier or cap change. C did not improve on B.</p><img src=\"/Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/routing-evidence/cost-by-routing.svg\"><img src=\"/Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/routing-evidence/success-by-routing.svg\"><img src=\"/Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/routing-evidence/size-cost.svg\"></body></html>';\nstore('finalComparisonHTML',html);const r=await tools.mcp__ao__html_preview({html,width:960});for(const c of r.content??[]){if(c.type==='image')image(c);else if(c.type==='text')text(c.text);}\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git status --short\",\"max_output_tokens\":200}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12fdc-361d-7d60-86d2-5cd5884aa9f4","create_time":1791805323.666089}}}
