Vaibhaav-Tiwari/neatlogs-hack/pull/147\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Report the verified version PR and exact external gate for the final release audit.\"}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"ao report --checkpoint --note 'Background comparison refresh: Pass B manifest landed. Same BENCH-2/4/5: all 3 passed, 3 model attempts + 3 separate startup retries; mean $0.1031085467, total $0.30932564. A mean $0.4056453333 total $1.216936, also 3/3 passed. Coverage 3/5 for both, C pending, no join exclusions, no final savings/history-driven claim. Readback cache predates both passes.' --artifact /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/routing-evidence/report.md\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Attach the regenerated evidence report as requested while release work remains the priority.\"}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"ao send --session neatlogs-hack-8 --message 'Release slice ready: PR #147 head 17ef6fb, 827 tests twice/typecheck/build clean, Node20.20.2 runtime demo/version pass, real doctor healthy-ready now connected, legacy init config sequential verified. Need merged final commit and matching release-source.json to do exact final tarball/empty-cache checks; no publish will be run. Background report refreshed for B: 3/3 passed, mean $0.1031085467, 3 startup retries separately; A/B cover 3/5, C pending.'\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Coordinate the required final merged release build and sanity-run gate with the orchestrator.\"}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git status --short\",\"max_output_tokens\":500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791804205.503098,"turn_id":"01a12fce-a573-76b3-a414-d175a23cff76"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_c6d7dd0c77df4e319b42e30446f2556e","guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":1200