ate and $5.00 average cost, uses the prior, config cap $5.00 (0 successful samples; 5 needed), model claude-sonnet-4.6 only (unknown-model observations excluded).\\nT7 attempt 1: worker dry-T7-1 started on top\\nT7 attempt 1: spend $0.00\\nT7 attempt 1: failed $0.4913 (The task is not solvable without scope and tax-policy inputs.)\\nwrote /private/tmp/tally-020-check.cbXeWd/scratch/.tally/runs/run-20261012-113026Z/run.json\\nwrote /private/tmp/tally-020-check.cbXeWd/scratch/.tally/runs/run-20261012-113026Z/ledger.json\\nupdated /private/tmp/tally-020-check.cbXeWd/scratch/.tally/runs/latest\\nfinished run-20261012-113026Z: 7 tasks, 9 attempts\\nIntegrations\\n  Integration  Status\\n  Neatlogs     off\\n  Entire       off\\n  cfo.ai       off\\n  GitHub       off\\n    Backlog loaded from file.\\n  Slack        off\\nRun summary\\n  Tasks: 6 passed, 1 failed, 0 skipped\\n  Total spend: $1.7063\\n  Run cap: $40.00\\nBudget availability\\n  Monthly remaining: $38.2937 of $40.00 (tally.yaml)\\n  Run cap: $40.00 (tally.yaml)\\n  Available now: $38.2937\\nrun folder /private/tmp/tally-020-check.cbXeWd/scratch/.tally/runs/run-20261012-113026Z\\n\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"content":null,"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0c048985e5fd68d5016accc4d7054087d0b14d1070af80e205","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12fdc-361d-7d60-86d2-5cd5884aa9f4"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"call_id":"call_azxvyyaB8647JppcgfQiFPRI","id":"ctc_0c048985e5fd68d5016accc4e9ce9487d0974928efe2ffbf75","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"ao project get fly-doom-jev --json\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Read an existing consented Codex AO project to support the requested real preflight plan check without changing it or spawning workers.\",\"max_output_tokens\":1500}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"sed -n '65,105p' engine/preflight.ts\"}));text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"sed -n