{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T12:21:28.939Z","ordinal":16435,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_004274e0102b2ff9016accd0c2f2588191a12ece1ae4562fdb","status":"completed","call_id":"call_7d322fae24244aa7b6df56fe32776f5a","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"ao report --checkpoint --note \\\"Reviewed #149 read-only: adds compiled evidence-links/pr-evidence modules and updated docs, no dependencies. New calls: Entire mirror readiness reads; consented mirror creation; gh pr view/edit to append links. No additional cfo.ai writes, but configured finance table URLs are automatically shared in task PR bodies without a dedicated init disclosure/opt-in. Mirror approval documented in HUMAN_APPROVALS is actually prompted. Neatlogs URLs are formed from IDs, not gated on verified read-back/page access. Preserved release-020 fallback tarball; awaiting new final source commit for release-020b; no publish.\\\"\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Persist the requested read-only release review findings to the orchestrator.\",\"max_output_tokens\":700}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1300c-41d0-7252-878d-fac3cabd2b16","create_time":1791807682.9541712}}}
