{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T12:21:43.263Z","ordinal":16440,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a125af-5d46-7871-9bed-a128df2c2957","turn_id":"01a1300c-41d0-7252-878d-fac3cabd2b16","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_004274e0102b2ff9016accd0d2d81081919ae38cb097d6a396","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"#149 adds two runtime modules (`evidence-links`, `pr-evidence`) and updated docs; no new dependencies.\nNew runtime calls check Entire mirror readiness and read/edit GitHub PR bodies; mirror creation requires an explicit prompt.\nNo new cfo.ai writes, but configured budget/spend URLs are automatically posted to PRs without a dedicated init disclosure or consent.\n`HUMAN_APPROVALS.md`’s mirror consent matches the code; Neatlogs links are formed from IDs without requiring verified read-back.\nThe `release-020` fallback is preserved; awaiting the new final commit for `release-020b`. Nothing published."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1791807699043,"completed_at_ms":1791807703263}}
