{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T13:07:27.012Z","ordinal":16460,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_004274e0102b2ff9016accdb8d97008191a2d4b4c2f3c7a84c","status":"completed","call_id":"call_2471e918e5634aa9a7fc41aeff1b7c19","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"sed -n '1,85p' /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/market-job-intent/report.md\",max_output_tokens:2200}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a13039-52ed-7140-86e2-0302da789af2","create_time":1791810445.5934567}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T13:07:27.202Z","ordinal":16461,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a125af-5d46-7871-9bed-a128df2c2957","turn_id":"01a13039-52ed-7140-86e2-0302da789af2","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-e5080a2e-cc95-47b7-b17f-f7a22cd2d101","process_id":"83534","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '1,85p' /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/market-job-intent/report.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/worktrees/neatlogs-hack/neatlogs-hack-5","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '1,85p' /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/market-job-intent/report.md","name":"report.md","path":"/Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/market-job-intent/report.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"# Find and qualify likely pilot companies\n\nRetrieved: 2026-10-11T14:57:46.905Z; API: 2025-11-01. Returned 20; API query matches: 35030.\nCredits reported: 0.75; conservative maximum estimate: 0.75.\nQuery SHA256: 239c297f5af0754b6d7d6e40668e399f40d9485ffa0018527c6291ac64829149. Cached replay: no API calls or new data.\n\nReviewed rows: 0; candidate: 0; vendor: 0; hiring intent: 20; verified use: 0; rejected: 0.\n\nProspects, not adoption or market size. Headcount is not coding-agent seats. Company reviews are manual judgements. Job labels require engineering category, explicit tool text, source and date; they establish hiring intent only, not deployed use or a qualified buyer. Posting companies can be staffing firms; cross-posts under different domains may refer to the same role/employer. Job dates are API date_added; postings may be stale. Company dates are API record updates, not publication dates. Sources are not independently visited.\n\nJob stage: 25 returned posts; 2 ambiguous/incomplete rows dropped; 3 duplicate-company posts grouped. 20 distinct companies, by normalized domain or company id.\n\n| Company | Label | Job title | Tool evidence | Source | Date |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Charles Schwab (schwab.com) | hiring intent | Java Engineer | ing engineering judgment and validation. Practical familiarity with tools such as GitHub Copilot or Claude Code is expected. What you have Required Qualifications Uses AI assistance for common dev tasks (code suggestions, test generation, review support, automation scripts, troubleshooting) with clear ownership for correctness and quality.Applies GenAI in ways that reduce context switching and acc | https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4475639024 | 2026-10-10T20:36:57 |\n| Advantage Technical (advantagetechnical.com) | hiring intent | Sr. Software Engineer (Software Engineer, Backend/AI (Remote) | ckend Development, APIs, NodeJS/Python, NoSQL database, AWS, AI-assisted programming tools, such as Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, GitHub Copilot, Work Authorization: Candidates must be legally authorized to work in the United States without current or future employer sponsorship. Visa sponsorship is not available. Position Overview We are seeking a Senior Software Engineer with deep backend developme | https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4477238047 | 2026-10-10T20:06:18 |\n| Aion (aionfi.com) | hiring intent | Senior Design Engineer |  output: progressive rendering, interruption and retry.You build daily with AI coding tools such as Claude Code, Cursor or Codex, use them to ship whole tools and products on your own, and review every line they write. Good to have Custom tools you built that others rely on: plugins, design and motion tooling, debug overlays, generators or internal apps.Something you started and shipped yourself:  | https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4478079556 | 2026-10-10T19:19:32 |\n| Inherent Technologies (inherenttechnologies.com) | hiring intent | AI/ML Engineer | nt with rapid prototyping, ambiguity, and iterative delivery. Required: Strong working knowledge of GitHub Copilot (or equivalent enterprise-approved AI coding assistant) to accelerate dev