{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T13:27:58.386Z","ordinal":16473,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a1304c-70b1-70d2-849a-d16caf2237f3","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"[from neatlogs-hack-8] NEW RELEASE CANDIDATE: main afbd376 = adot-7's #149 (sponsor evidence links on PRs) plus lane A's #151 (hermetic test, 15 s bounds on the GitHub evidence calls, a suite guard against real adapters). Gated: 839 tests x2 with no credentials visible, typecheck, build, dry runs. When release-source.json on the release branch shows afbd376, repeat the full pre-release check into release-020b/: pack from that built release commit, audit contents, sha256, empty-cache clean-prefix install on the default runtime and Node 20, the command list, the 0.1.0-config upgrade check. Report path, files, size, sha256, the release commit hash and the publish command. Also give me your five-line read of #149 (new run-time network calls, anything written to the user's PRs or cfo.ai without consent at tally init). Keep release-020/ (6196474) untouched as the fallback. No publish."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1304c-6bc6-74e2-abf0-d7073703152e","create_time":1791811678.385819,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a1304c-70b1-70d2-849a-d16caf2237f3","turn_id":"01a1304c-6bc6-74e2-abf0-d7073703152e","role":"user"},"revision":"retained_01a1304c-70b1-70d2-849a-d18241b71ff5","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1656,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"complete","sources":[{"server_name":"node_repl","tool_name":"js","first_turn_id":"01a12a97-e4ab-7890-8387-c5ab0eeee751"},{"server_name":"ao","tool_name":"html_preview","first_turn_id":"01a12f92-ff72-7412-8b38-fb74800a991a"},{"server_name":"ao","tool_name":"html_render","first_turn_id":"01a12fc0-e6ed-70d3-9280-cf68527cb68a"}]}}}
