{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T19:21:44.437Z","ordinal":16793,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a13190-52f5-75b3-8251-ef0d7059caa8","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"[from neatlogs-hack-8] Vaibhaav wants npm updated to the latest merged code: prepare tally-agents 0.2.1. main is f666957; I gated it just now with no credentials visible: 882 tests x2, typecheck, build, three dry runs. Since 0.2.0 (afbd376) main gained: adot-7's #150 (onboarding polish, Ari context and per-attempt reports to cfo.ai) and #152 (run publication and integration status fixes, one retry for transient git push failures), lane A's #159 (Entire stays connected when the graph matches no symbols), #156 docs/BUSINESS_PLAN.md, #160 site, and a direct commit f666957 changing .entire/settings.json. Do: (1) small PR bumping package.json and package-lock.json to 0.2.1 and any version test; nothing else in it. Tell me the number; I gate and merge at once. (2) When I send the merged commit and the release branch has built it: full pre-release check into /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/release-021/: pack from the built release commit, audit contents (no tests, secrets, .env, .tally, .claude, .codex, site/, the external-services guard), sha256, empty-cache clean-prefix install on the default runtime and Node 20, the command list, the 0.1.0-config and a 0.2.0-config upgrade check, tally market --replay. (3) Read #150 and #152 for anything a user did not consent to at tally init: #150 says it adds a managed guide to the cfo.ai page and enables per-attempt reports to the cfo.ai workspace: confirm init asks before doing that and say exactly what is sent. Five lines. Report path, files, size, sha256, release commit hash and the publish command. No publish."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a13190-4b5d-74c2-9db6-6b4f1c0c4022","create_time":1791832904.437611,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a13190-52f5-75b3-8251-ef0d7059caa8","turn_id":"01a13190-4b5d-74c2-9db6-6b4f1c0c4022","role":"user"},"revision":"retained_01a13190-52f5-75b3-8251-ef2c82693711","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1673,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"complete","sources":[{"server_name":"node_repl","tool_name":"js","first_turn_id":"01a12a97-e4ab-7890-8387-c5ab0eeee751"},{"server_name":"ao","tool_name":"html_preview","first_turn_id":"01a12f92-ff72-7412-8b38-fb74800a991a"},{"server_name":"ao","tool_name":"html_render","first_turn_id":"01a12fc0-e6ed-70d3-9280-cf68527cb68a"}]}}}
