{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T19:25:08.294Z","ordinal":16880,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_004274e0102b2ff9016acd340d28d08191b4d6e5244025a97a","status":"completed","call_id":"call_68fee0822de44756bc5e034860239b09","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"ao report --checkpoint --note \\\"Version-only PR #166 open, head d62f055 from f666957: package/root-lock 0.2.1 and required matching CLI VERSION; version test, typecheck and diff check pass. No publish; awaiting merged source/release build for release-021 audit. Consent read: fresh init explicitly asks budget/spend/Ari context; re-init only asks Enable cfo.ai integration and may silently enable new reporting. Guide writes only Tally-marked page block; future real-attempt reports go to organization memory via edit_memory, guarded by publishRunContext, never dry runs. Payload: repo/run/task title+IDs/issue URL, size/confidence/graph counts, model/provider/prices/tokens/cost, ceiling/outcome/decision/reason/times/commit, budgets and evidence URLs; not issue bodies/code/diffs/prompts/transcripts/raw traces. Free-text redaction is not a universal privacy guarantee. #152 adds GH credential helper scoped to push subprocess+one retry, no new finance writes; previous PR finance-URL sharing remains without a dedicated question.\\\" --pr-created https://github.com/Vaibhaav-Tiwari/neatlogs-hack/pull/166\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Deliver the ready version PR and material onboarding consent findings for release gating.\",\"max_output_tokens\":600}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a13190-4b5d-74c2-9db6-6b4f1c0c4022","create_time":1791833101.162584}}}
