xpected missing auth; configured exit0), init help, plan with new fields, replay, unchanged 0.1 sequential and 0.2 configs. No guards/tests/settings/site/known credentials packed. Old removed flydoom project initially blocked plan; final check reads registered chip project only, changes nothing. Consent concerns preserved in report: fresh init asks combined Ari context; re-init generic question can enable reports; PR finance URLs still lack dedicated disclosure. OTP command in attached report; awaiting lane A sanity gate.\" --artifact /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/release-021/report.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":484720958},"formatted_output":""},"started_at_ms":1791833801578,"completed_at_ms":1791833802063}}
