\\n\\n```bash\\n# Give the agent new instructions mid-task\\nao send --session mer-3 --message \\\"The issue is in session_manager.go line 142, not in the CLI. Investigate there.\\\"\\n```\\n\\n```bash\\n# Steer the active Chat turn, or start a normal turn if it is idle\\nao send --session mer-3 --steer --message \\\"Use the daemon DTO as the source of truth.\\\"\\n```\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"f6172b\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.505068125,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a131aa-8bd4-7dc0-9e91-8071b2de8f12","create_time":1791834722.416359}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
