{"timestamp":"2026-10-12T19:55:30.628Z","ordinal":17193,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a131af-3dc4-7a32-beba-ec94ea5d4e5d","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"[from neatlogs-hack-8] Yes, there is live proof of learned ceilings, from Vaibhaav's own runs on published 0.2.0; I copied both run folders to durable paths and read the ledgers myself. (1) /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-8/user-runs/othello/run-20261012-153240Z (repo Vaibhaav-Tiwari/Othello): task #4, small, cheap luna, decision 'History for cheap uses neatlogs: 6 observations, 100% pass rate and 0.0111 average cost', ceilingNanos 22849860 (0.0228 USD, not the configured value), passed at 0.01816744, PR Othello#5. (2) /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-8/user-runs/selfhost/run-20261012-162757Z (Tally run on its own repo, a fresh clone of neatlogs-hack): tasks #155 and #157 started on cheap luna with a learned ceiling of 0.02725116, were STOPPED at it (0.02817828 and 0.0277058), escalated to middle terra and passed (0.1954928 and 0.3815336), PRs neatlogs-hack #163 and #162; #158, #154 passed on cheap; five PRs #161-#165 in all. That is a learned ceiling causing a real stop-and-escalate. Read the ledgers yourself before citing: check failureAssessment on the stopped rows and whether the escalations stayed on the same branch, and state what the files show, no more. Use these in the README evidence section and docs/EVIDENCE.md."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a131aa-8bd4-7dc0-9e91-8071b2de8f12","create_time":1791834930.628477,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a131af-3dc4-7a32-beba-ec94ea5d4e5d","turn_id":"01a131aa-8bd4-7dc0-9e91-8071b2de8f12","role":"user"},"revision":"retained_01a131af-3dc4-7a32-beba-ecb635572d7d","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1688,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"complete","sources":[{"server_name":"node_repl","tool_name":"js","first_turn_id":"01a12a97-e4ab-7890-8387-c5ab0eeee751"},{"server_name":"ao","tool_name":"html_preview","first_turn_id":"01a12f92-ff72-7412-8b38-fb74800a991a"},{"server_name":"ao","tool_name":"html_render","first_turn_id":"01a12fc0-e6ed-70d3-9280-cf68527cb68a"}]}}}
