\\\":28178280,\\\"result\\\":\\\"stopped\\\",\\\"assessment\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"ceiling\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"ledger\\\",\\\"traceId\\\":null,\\\"spans\\\":[],\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Ledger fallback: worker trace could not be read; attempt result stopped classifies as ceiling.\\\"],\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Ledger fallback: worker trace could not be read; attempt result stopped classifies as ceiling.\\\",\\\"retryable\\\":true},\\\"decision\\\":\\\"History for cheap uses neatlogs: 6 observations, 100% pass rate and $0.0116 average cost; small task with 2 files touched from the issue text and a search of the repository (Graph impact), no dependents and tests present; related context (not targets): schema/tally-config.schema.json, tally.yaml, engine/plan.ts, ... starts on cheap capped at $0.0273, expected to cost $0.0273 against $1.50 for going straight to top; top none: 0 observations, prior 95% pass rate and $1.50 average cost, uses the prior, config cap $1.50 (0 successful samples; 5 needed), model gpt-5.6-sol only (unknown-model observations excluded); cheap neatlogs: 6 observations, 100% pass rate, $0.0116 average cost, observed statistics, cap $0.0273 from P90 $0.0182 x 1.5 over 6 successful samples, max $0.30, model gpt-5.6-luna only (unknown-model observations excluded); middle none: 0 observations, prior 83% pass rate and $0.75 average cost, uses the prior, config cap $0.75 (0 successful samples; 5 needed), model gpt-5.6-terra only (unknown-model observations excluded).\\\",\\\"pr\\\":null,\\\"from\\\":null,\\\"handoff\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"checkpoint\\\":\\\"01M4RF933E2MPZHXDDJ56E81VF\\\"}\\n{\\\"task\\\":\\\"#158\\\",\\\"attempt\\\":1,\\\"branch\\\":\\\"ao/tally-selfhost-3/root\\\",\\\"baseCommit\\\":\\\"d9e2bb609404a1c363572c98a1e01b30df9ecf8f\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\\"ceiling\\\":800000000,\\\"cost\\\":66083760,\\\"result\\\":\\\"passed\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"History for cheap uses neatlogs: 4 observations, 100% pass rate and $0.0169 average cost; medium task with 2 files touched from the issue text and a search of the repository (Graph impact), 64 dependents and tests present; related context (not targets): schema/money.ts, adapters/cfoai-context.ts starts on cheap capped at $0.80, expected to cost $0.80 against $4.00 for going straight to top; top none: 0 observations, prior 90% pass rate and $4.00 average cost, uses the prior, config cap $4.00 (0 successful samples; 5 needed), model gpt-5.6-sol only (unknown-model observations excluded); cheap neatlogs: 4 observations, 100% pass rate, $0.0169 average cost, observed statistics, config cap $0.80 (4 successful samples; 5 needed), model gpt-5.6-luna only (unknown-model observations excluded); middle none: 0 observations, prior 68% pass rate and $2.00 average cost, uses the prior, config cap $2.00 (0 successful samples; 5 needed), model gpt-5.6-terra only (unknown-model observations excluded).\\\",\\\"pr\\\":\\\"https://github.com/Vaibhaav-Tiwari/neatlogs-hack/pull/161\\\",\\\"from\\\":null,\\\"handoff\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"checkpoint\\\":\\\"01M4RF9E0S8XB9AV5XM4SWR71E\\\"}\\n{\\\"task\\\":\\\"#157\\\",\\\"attempt\\\":2,\\\"branch\\\":\\\"ao/tally-selfhost-1/root\\\",\\\"baseCommit\\\":\\\"b83325fe3439c5774b59504aadee0f9640733c3b\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"gpt-5.6-terra\\\",\\\"ceiling\\\":750000000,\\\"cost\\\":381533600,\\\"result\\\":\\\"passed\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"Cheap attempt was stopped at its ceiling, so it escalates one tier to middle capped at $0.75, continuing from the Entire handoff summary with $6.3950 of budget left; none history: 0 observations, prior 83% pass rate and $0.75 average cost, uses the prior, configured cap (0 successful samples; 5 needed), model gpt-5.6-terra only (unknown-model observations excluded); Ledger fallback: worker trace could not be read; attempt result stopped classifies as ceiling.\\\",\\\"pr\\\":\\\"https://github.com/Vaibhaav-Tiwari/neatlogs-hack/pull/162\\\",\\\"from\\\":\\\"run-20261012-162757Z:#157:1\\\",\\\"han